WEBVTT

00:00:29.108 --> 00:00:31.569
I can make suggestions
based on your budget

00:00:31.611 --> 00:00:34.072
and her public Instagram profile.

00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:35.907
Say "yes" to proceed.

00:00:36.657 --> 00:00:38.117
Karen Lellouche Tordjman: Yes.

00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:42.872
So, thrilling or scary?

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:46.918
Because this is how our future
could look very soon.

00:00:47.585 --> 00:00:50.421
As a working mom, I find it exciting.

00:00:51.089 --> 00:00:54.592
I would love to stop
doing Google searches,

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:58.971
wasting time doing Amazon scrolling,
budget calculation

00:00:59.013 --> 00:01:01.641
or optimizing my calendar.